    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Process Order Sub-workflow\n\nReusable workflow for order processing.\n\nCalled by:\nOrder Webhook Processor\n\n## What it does\n1. Checks whether the order already exists\n2. Prevents duplicate records\n3. Inserts new orders into the Data Table\n4. Calls the processing API\n5. Updates processing status and processed_at\n6. Skips already existing orders\n7. Returns a normalized result to the parent workflow\n\n## Inputs\n- order_id (string)\n- customer_id (string)\n- total (number)\n\n## Returns\n- order_id\n- stored\n- stored_order\n- processing_result\n- processed_at\n\n## Data Storage\nData Table:\norders\n"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        608,
        -384
      ],
      "id": "973a7ac0-d4e8-41fd-87ca-7376f6990a65",
      "name": "Sticky Note"
    }
